{
  "title": "EBS · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "EC2에 연결해 사용하는 영구 블록 스토리지입니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>EBS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Block Store)</span></span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#guide-1\">볼륨을 연결하고 사용하기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#guide-2\">성능과 보호 설정</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#notes\">각주</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>스토리지</span><span>13 / 62</span></div><h1>EBS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Block Store)</span></h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>EBS는 <strong>EC2에 디스크처럼 연결해 사용하는 블록 스토리지<sup><a aria-label=\"각주 1\" class=\"concept-note-ref\" href=\"#note-1\" id=\"note-ref-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">[1]</a></sup></strong>입니다. 운영체제, 애플리케이션 파일, 데이터베이스 데이터 등을 저장합니다.</p><p>볼륨은 EC2 인스턴스와 별도로 존재하므로 중지 후에도 데이터를 보관할 수 있습니다. 인스턴스를 종료할 때 볼륨을 함께 삭제할지는 연결 설정에 따라 달라집니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"comparison\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"gp3\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"gp2\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"io2-block-express\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"io1\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"st1\"></span><h2>볼륨을 연결하고 사용하기</h2><p>볼륨과 EC2는 같은 AZ에 있어야 합니다. 새 데이터 볼륨을 연결한 뒤 운영체제에서 파일 시스템을 만들고 마운트하면 일반 디스크처럼 사용할 수 있습니다.</p><p>다른 AZ에 데이터가 필요하면 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/snapshot/\">스냅샷</a>에서 새 볼륨을 생성하는 방식을 사용할 수 있습니다. 여러 서버의 공유 폴더가 필요하면 EFS나 FSx도 비교합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"sc1-and-magnetic\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"ebs-multi-attach\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"encryption\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"elastic-volumes\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"deleteontermination-and-persistence\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"ebs-optimized-and-monitoring\"></span><h2>성능과 보호 설정</h2><p>일반적인 SSD 작업에는 gp3를, 높은 입출력 성능과 일관된 지연이 필요한 작업에는 io2 등을 검토합니다. 대량의 순차 읽기·쓰기에는 HDD 계열이 적합한지 비교합니다.</p><p>용량, IOPS, 처리량과 EC2 쪽의 지원 성능을 함께 확인합니다. 암호화와 정기 스냅샷을 설정하고, 종료 시 삭제 옵션이 데이터 보존 요구에 맞는지 검토합니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>EC2에서 EBS를 사용하는 과정</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ol class=\"concept-flow\"><li><strong>볼륨 생성</strong><span>크기·성능·암호화</span></li><li><strong>EC2에 연결</strong><span>같은 AZ의 인스턴스</span></li><li><strong>파일 시스템 사용</strong><span>마운트 후 데이터 저장</span></li></ol><p class=\"diagram-note\">볼륨의 수명과 서버의 수명을 분리해 관리할 수 있습니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>EC2에서 운영하는 데이터베이스의 데이터 디스크를 EBS로 구성합니다. 성능 지표에 맞춰 볼륨을 조절하고, 스냅샷으로 복구 시점을 보관합니다.</p></section><section class=\"concept-notes\" id=\"notes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"><h2>각주</h2><ol><li id=\"note-1\"><strong>블록 스토리지</strong> — 운영체제에 디스크 장치처럼 제공되는 저장 방식입니다. 운영체제가 그 위에 파일 시스템이나 데이터베이스 저장 구조를 구성합니다. <a aria-label=\"각주 1의 본문으로 돌아가기\" class=\"concept-note-back\" href=\"#note-ref-1\">↩</a></li></ol></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/ebs/latest/userguide/ebs-volume-types.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Amazon EBS volume types ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-2\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/ebs/latest/userguide/ebs-volumes.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Amazon EBS volumes ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q039/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q039\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q039\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q039</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q039/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An EC2 instance needs an operating-system-visible volume for database files. What type of storage is required?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q039\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Block storage</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q039\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Object storage</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q039\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">DNS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q039\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Publish/subscribe messaging</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a> 같은 블록 장치가 파일 시스템을 생성해 사용하는 볼륨이다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/\">Object / File / Block</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q044\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q044\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q044</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q044/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Can an EBS volume in AZ A be attached directly to an EC2 instance in AZ B?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q044\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">No. The volume and instance must be in the same AZ</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q044\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes. Both AZs are in the same Region</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q044\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, if the instance has a public IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q044\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, if CloudFront is configured</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a> 볼륨과 연결 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>는 같은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>여야 한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/snapshot/\">스냅샷</a>에서 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> B에 새 볼륨을 만들 수 있다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/snapshot/\">EBS Snapshot</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q045\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q045\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q045</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q045/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company needs a general-purpose SSD volume for an EC2 boot or application workload and wants to adjust IOPS and throughput. Which EBS type should it choose first?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q045\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">EFS One Zone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q045\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Standard</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q045\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">sc1</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q045\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">gp3</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#gp3\">gp3</a>는 범용 SSD <span class=\"full-name\">(Solid State Drive)</span>이며 용량과 별도로 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#iops-throughput-and-latency\">IOPS</a>·처리량 설정을 조정할 수 있다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q052\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q052\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q052</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q052/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to centrally manage backup schedules and retention policies for EBS and RDS across multiple accounts. Which service should it choose?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q052\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A Network Load Balancer</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q052\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An SCP alone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q052\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Backup</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q052\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon CloudFront</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">AWS Backup</a>은 지원 리소스의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">백업</a> 계획과 보존을 중앙화한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">AWS Backup</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q096\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q096\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q096</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q096/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A workload needs an HDD-based EBS volume optimized for throughput during large sequential reads and writes. Which type should it consider first?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q096\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Only io2</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q096\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">st1</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q096\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Only gp3</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q096\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 One Zone-IA</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#st1\">st1</a>은 처리량 최적화 HDD <span class=\"full-name\">(Hard Disk Drive)</span>다. 부팅 볼륨으로는 사용할 수 없다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/\">이전 용어 <b>DynamoDB</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/snapshot/\">다음 용어 <b>EBS Snapshot</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
